english.InstallerStartFailed=Could not start the ACTOVO installer.
english.InstallerExitCode=Installer exit code:
english.InstallFailed=ACTOVO installation failed:
english.ElevatedSetupUnsupported=Start ACTOVO Setup normally. Do not use Run as administrator. Setup requests UAC only when it needs to clean up an old scheduled task or enable administrator-enhanced core mode.
english.ElevatedModeFallbackNotice=Windows could not enable administrator-enhanced core mode. ACTOVO continued in standard user mode; normal local use is unaffected. If you need administrator-enhanced mode, check your Windows/UAC policy and enable it later.
