english.UpgradeSetupManaged=Setup will upgrade or repair ACTOVO and preserve the current startup, connection, tasks, Skills, and configuration.
english.UpgradeLegacyManaged=An existing PowerShell installation was found. Setup will migrate it to the graphical installer and preserve the current startup, connection, tasks, Skills, and configuration.
english.InstallDirectoryInUse=ACTOVO is installed in the folder below. Use that folder to upgrade. To choose a different folder, uninstall the current installation while keeping user data, then run Setup again.
english.ReadyUpgrade=Setup is ready to upgrade or repair ACTOVO.
