english.OfflineProgressFinishing=Starting ACTOVO and checking its status...
english.FinishedControlPanel=ACTOVO installation is complete. Click Finish to open ACTOVO Control Panel. You can also open it later from the Start menu or system tray.
english.FinishedDeferredControlPanel=ACTOVO installation is complete. Windows did not complete immediate runtime activation or verification. Startup settings were saved; open ACTOVO from the Start menu or sign in to Windows again to retry.
